    <text class="f2-t f2-b" x="80" y="253"><tspan class="l-en">capex held + opinc commitment defended + first compute/subscription detail</tspan><tspan class="l-zh">资本开支不再上调 + 守住营业利润承诺 + 首次算力/订阅细节</tspan></text>
