<div class="callout key"><span class="co-h">{{ t('Verdict on the central question', '对核心问题的判定') }}</span>
{{ t('Will Meta rerate the way Google did? <strong>Probably yes — on Google&rsquo;s actual schedule, not on the folk-memory one.</strong> Google&rsquo;s haven quarter came <em>after</em> its de-risking event, with proof printed and dilution absent. Meta&rsquo;s equivalents — the FTC appeal, the compute launch, the first disclosed number, the equity-raise resolution — mature between September and January. We put ~40&ndash;45% on Meta leading the megacap pack out of the October-window low (the highest of any single name), but only ~15&ndash;20% on it absorbing capital <em>through</em> the correction the way Google did in Q4-2025 [S]. If Meta is making new highs in August while memory bleeds, read it as distribution-financed exit liquidity — the tell from the July 1 session, where Meta added ~$98B of market cap while its suppliers fell 12&ndash;17% — not as the haven confirming.',
      'Meta 会像谷歌那样重估吗？<strong>大概率会——但按谷歌真实的时间表，而不是民间记忆里的那份。</strong>谷歌的避险季度发生在其去风险事件<em>之后</em>：证据已打印、稀释不存在。Meta 的对应物——FTC 上诉、算力业务发布、第一个披露数字、股权融资的了结——要在 9 月至次年 1 月之间陆续成熟。我们给「Meta 领跑十月窗口低点后的巨头行情」约 40&ndash;45% 的概率（单一标的中最高），但只给「Meta 像谷歌 2025 年四季度那样在调整期间持续吸纳资金」约 15&ndash;20% [S]。如果 8 月存储板块失血时 Meta 却在创新高，请把它读作派发资金的出货流动性——7月1日那一课：Meta 单日增加约 980 亿美元市值、其供应商同日下跌 12&ndash;17%——而不是避风港的确认。') }}
</div>

<h2 id="cast"><span class="num">5</span>{{ t('The full cast, scored', '全体候选人打分') }}</h2>

