<div class="pquote"><p>
<span class="l-en">The market is not choosing a stock to hide in; it is choosing the order in which it pays for proof. Apple already showed its receipts, so it gets the correction. Meta&rsquo;s receipts are dated October — which is why October, not this rally, is where its Google impression either lands the role or leaves the stage.</span>
<span class="l-zh">市场不是在挑一只可以躲的股票，而是在排定为证据付款的顺序。Apple 已经出示过收据，所以它领走这轮调整。Meta 的收据落款是十月——所以是十月、而不是眼下这轮反弹，决定它的谷歌模仿秀是拿下角色，还是退场。</span>
</p></div>

